title: Maryland Hospital Global Budget Revenue Dataset
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Ahmadi
    given-names: Farzin
    affiliation: Towson University
    email: fahmadi@towson.edu
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0606-1707"
version: 0.1.3
date-released: 2026-11-10
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22947752
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A versioned, machine-readable compilation of Maryland Health Services Cost
  Review Commission (HSCRC) public reports on the state's all-payer hospital
  global budget system. Covers hospital revenue and volume by month, rate
  center, setting, payer and patient residence for FY2017-FY2026; approved
  global budget targets for rate years 2019-2026 and quality program revenue
  adjustments for rate years 2016-2027; statewide and hospital-level financial
  condition for FY2005-FY2025, extracted from PDF; a hospital crosswalk linking
  HSCRC hospital numbers to CMS Certification Numbers and every name variant
  observed; and a sourced reference table of rate center codes.
keywords:
  - Maryland
  - global budget revenue
  - all-payer model
  - hospital finance
  - health policy
  - HSCRC
  - AHEAD model
